{"reviews":[{"id":"B072KGXRV4-0","r":1.0,"t":"Junk","x":"Not worth the price at all. Wish I could just return them but apparently they aren't eligible for return. What a waste of money. I bet the Dollar Tree has better quality. I should have paid more attention to the other reviews.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-1","r":3.0,"t":"Okay","x":"These are very pretty but they are too soft and don't do a great job at removing nail dust.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-2","r":5.0,"t":"Nice brushes","x":"These brushes are really nice for the price. I use one for blending my blush after its applied. The other one I use for applying dry shampoo powder to my roots. They do lose a few bristles here and there but it's not been an issue really for the purposes I use. Love these and would definately buy again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-3","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome brushes","x":"These are so nice and so soft! Great product!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-4","r":5.0,"t":"Tiny but useful","x":"I added these to my personal nail care kit that I bring to the salon (anything that touches me).  In these viral times, I am NOT taking any chances on them using devices on me they used on others.  No matter how little it seems, the virus is even tinnier.......","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great price, very soft","x":"Great price for the brushes. Purchased for my wife who does her nails at home. She uses them to brush off any acrylic dust or powder. She commented on how soft and fluffy the brushes were considering the price.  She would recommend.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-6","r":5.0,"t":"Works Great for dip powder and filing","x":"Does exactly what i need! I use it to dust after filing. Gets most residue off! A little bit of polisg dried up on it but it still works great and it doesn\u2019t shed! Used it on 7 different clients so far and it\u2019s still in great shape","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-7","r":5.0,"t":"Nice but not perfect.","x":"Nice brushes, very close to the ones in the salon.  Wish that the handle end was flat so it could be set aside during the dipping procedure, like they do at the salon.  As it is, the pointy end means have lay it on its side.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-8","r":4.0,"t":"fast shipping","x":"the items shipped fast, but one brush was broken, the glue holding the brush to the handle was not enough to hold it together. The other brush arrived fine, though the way they are made I am not sure how ling they will last.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-9","r":3.0,"t":"o.k brushes","x":"these work, but it was obvious the first day that they are cheaply made. the handle separated from the brush the first time I used it. Just a small amount of some kind of rubbery adhesive was used so it wan't very sturdy.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-10","r":5.0,"t":"Nice and love the size","x":"Brush is smaller than you hand or is the size of about the palm of your hand. The brush portion is thick and perfect for brushing off excess dipped powder without it hardening the bristles like some smaller brushes.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-11","r":4.0,"t":"What you see is what you get","x":"They are so cute just too small. I was Thinking bigger maybe I read wrong. After 1 use the pink one broke but I glued it together. Overall for the price you can\u2019t complain too much can ya?","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-12","r":1.0,"t":"Poorly made","x":"I was actually upset about one of the brush it came with. I literally use the brush once and the whole thing came apart. It looks as though the pieces were not properly glued together.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-13","r":2.0,"t":"Bummer","x":"Just opened my package to find one is broken. Very cheaply made, seems they can break easily. A little disappointed with the purchase. Do not recommend.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-14","r":3.0,"t":"Handle fell off","x":"Fell apart after one use.  I still use it without the handle but would recommend looking for a different brush if you want one where the handle stays on","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-15","r":3.0,"t":"eh","x":"Kinda upset I bought this I went to my local nail supply and bought a big one for cheaper than the both of these little mini ones that are quite pricy!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-16","r":5.0,"t":"Works as intended","x":"The brush is soft and the price is good for two brushes. I use them for mail dust doing my nails at home. They are small. A perfect size for my needs.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-17","r":1.0,"t":"DO NOT BUY!!","x":"These products were very, very, cheaply made. I didn't even get to use them because they fell apart near the metal area. Also, you can't return them.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-18","r":3.0,"t":"Lil brushes perfect for nails!","x":"The bristles were not as soft as I expected. Some were a little haywire. For the price I can\u2019t complain and they get the job done. I\u2019d buy again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-19","r":3.0,"t":"Garbage, fell apart first use! Gave me a refund though.","x":"Fell apart the first and second (the second brush) time I used them. Straight in the trash they went. Easy to work with on returns.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-20","r":1.0,"t":"Color Bleeds onto Nail Dip Powder","x":"Got these to dust off nail dip powder but the color on the brushes (pink & purple) bled onto my nails and discolored my polish. \ud83d\ude1e","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-21","r":5.0,"t":"GREAT ITEMS","x":"I love Amazon and Partners Always with a great Products an Best Prices in Town... Good Job Keep it Up... Blessings,.. LH.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-22","r":3.0,"t":"Broke but still able to use","x":"It gets the access Dust from the acrylic nails off okay but the handle isn\u2019t glued on very well and broke off.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-23","r":5.0,"t":"Works great for nails.","x":"Just what I was needing for my dip nails. Work well. No loose or shedding bristles. Love the fun colors too!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B072KGXRV4-24","r":3.0,"t":"way to small for what I need.","x":"If the size  is in the description, I missed it or not good. I needed the head to beat least twice the size.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the brushes soft and nice for the price, using them for nails, makeup, and dry shampoo.","cites":[3,4,6,7,11]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the brush head separates from the handle or arrives broken, calling them cheaply made.","cites":[9,10,12,13,14,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the brushes are smaller than expected.","cites":[5,11,12]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the brushes shed or are too soft to remove nail dust effectively.","cites":[2,3]},{"text":"One reviewer wishes the handle end were flat so it could stand upright during dipping.","cites":[8]}]},"qa":[]}